\begin_layout Standard
cyw43_arch_init () is the primary function used in the Raspberry Pi Pico SDK to initialize the CYW43 wireless driver chip and the lwIP TCP/IP networking stack on the Pico W and Pico 2 W.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Calling cyw43_arch_init () is a prerequisite for using Wi-Fi or Bluetooth.
