\begin_layout Standard
This function sets the fields of the global cyw43_state object of type cyw43_t.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
In particular,
 it's associating a series of RP2040 GPIO pins as inputs/outputs for interfacing with various of the CYW43's inputs/outputs.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Of particular note is that it sets the cyw43_poll field to NULL and sets the initted field to true.
 These will be important details later on.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
